title: "Myriaxon Harness"
abstract: >-
  An agentic harness for the terminal and the browser: persistent agents (Loci), a filesystem coordination board
  for multi-agent work, an eight-layer transparency dial, and a security model with one execution gate for every
  path that runs a shell.
